{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36354","headline":"许员外新阳别业 · 方干","name":"许员外新阳别业","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兰汀橘岛映亭台，不是经心即手栽。\n满阁白云随雨去，一池寒月逐潮来。\n小松出屋和巢长，新迳通村避笋开。\n柳絮风前欹枕卧，荷花香里棹舟回。\n园中认叶封林草，檐下攀枝落野梅。\n莫恣高情求逸思，须防急诏用长材。\n若因萤火终残卷，便把渔歌送几杯。\n多谢郢中贤太守，常时谈笑许追陪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36354.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36354","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}